{
  "description": "Type the per-class refusals of fork and pause. Observed live 2026-11-04 on Daytona Cloud v0.229.2: on a container-class sandbox from the default snapshot, POST /sandbox/{id}/fork answers 422 \"Forking is not supported for this sandbox\" and POST /sandbox/{id}/pause answers 422 \"Pausing is not supported for this sandbox\". POST /sandbox/{id}/autopause/{interval} on a container answers 422 \"Auto-pause is not supported for sandbox class 'container'. Supported classes: linux-vm, windows\". GET /sandbox/{id}/build-logs-url for a sandbox booted from a snapshot answers 404 \"Sandbox {id} has no build info\", which otherwise matches SandboxNotFound. A create with queueTimeout in an organization without the feature answers 403 \"Queue timeout is not enabled for this organization\". GET /sandbox/{id}/region-quota is for Daytona's runners: an organization API key gets 403 \"Invalid authentication context\" (a user's OAuth session gets 401), observed live 2026-11-04.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.daytona.sandbox#ForkNotSupported",
      "value": {
        "type": "structure",
        "members": {
          "message": {
            "target": "smithy.api#String"
          }
        },
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#error": "client",
          "smithy.api#httpError": 422,
          "smithy.api#documentation": "The sandbox's class or snapshot can't be forked (HTTP 422).",
          "com.distilled.openapi#errorMatchers": [
            {
              "status": 422,
              "message": {
                "includes": "Forking is not supported"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
